  "missing_connection": "The theorem turns these derived blocks into a finite window and a Schur response. The Dirac image is mostly outside the six columns, so that window is not the evolution. At the saved T=0.05 frame the same action functional and the same supplied L and beta gauge remain, while nonconstant Q removes the Omega^n scaling of the kinetic block. Renewal, an invariant six-mode structure, and a local response that stays inside the window are not obtained. The geometric grading is the supplied initial gauge.",
